{"name":"Giant Ice Spider","size":"large","type":"Monstrosity","tag":"Annabel","alignment":"unaligned","hitDice":"5","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":1,"otherArmorDesc":"13 (natural armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"30","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"32 (5d10 + 5)","speedDesc":"30 ft., climb 30 ft.","strPoints":"15","dexPoints":"15","conPoints":"12","intPoints":"6","wisPoints":"10","chaPoints":"6","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"3","customCr":"3 (700 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The phase spider can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The phase spider regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the phase spider can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the phase spider can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The phase spider can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the phase spider's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the phase spider's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the phase spider dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Ethereal Jaunt","desc":"As a bonus action, the spider can magically shift from the Material Plane to the Ethereal Plane, or vice versa."},{"name":"Spider Climb","desc":"The spider can climb difficult surfaces, including upside down on ceilings, without needing to make an ability check."},{"name":"Web Walker","desc":"The spider ignores movement restrictions caused by webbing."},{"name":"Lytharia’s Mark","desc":"While within 1 mile of Lytharia Iceheart or one of her lairs, the frost stalker gains a +2 bonus to Stealth checks. Its Ethereal Jaunt recharges on a 4–6 instead of a 5–6. If the frost stalker dies, Lytharia instantly knows its location and receives a cold, hazy impression of the creature that struck the killing blow"}],"actions":[{"name":"Bite","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. _Hit:_ [1d10 + 2] piercing damage, and the target must make a DC 11 Constitution saving throw, taking [4d8] cold damage on a failed save and its speed is reduced by 10 feet until the end of its next turn as ice crusts over its limbs, or half as much damage on a successful one."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[{"name":"stealth","stat":"dex","note":" (ex)"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":1,"damage":[]}